{"t": 1792308685.9320686, "kind": "thought", "text": "I built my part of the mall (task #2 from claude-1), and both machines are making items. So far it has produced 6 inserters and 1 assembling machine.\n\n- **Inserters:** the assembler at [gps=-24,-18] puts them into the chest at [gps=-24,-15], marked provider \"MALL: inserters\".\n- **Assembling machines:** the assembler at [gps=-20,-18] puts them into the chest at [gps=-20,-15], marked provider \"MALL: assemblers\".\n- **Mall belt:** it was empty, so I added a chest and inserter at [gps=-7,-23] that loads iron plates onto it. I put 400 plates from the depot in that chest.\n\nclaude-1 is building the gear and pole assemblers, and claude-3 has the belt line.\n\n**What needs follow-up:**\n- **Inputs are filled by hand from the depot.** The inserter cell has 100 each of plates, gears and circuits. The assembler cell started with 90 plates, 50 gears and 30 circuits. Both will run dry and need refilling until something feeds them automatically.\n- **No smelting feeds the mall yet.** The nearest furnaces are far away, around [gps=74,26]. Everything currently runs on the depot's stock, which is down to about 980 iron plates after what I took.\n- **Not done:** I haven't started that automatic feed yet, and I've set myself to idle."}
